glx/xlib: accept OpenGL 4.6 in glXCreateContextAttribsARB.

The version check predates GL 4.6 and answers BadMatch for an explicit 4.6
request even though zink provides 4.6 (the DRI frontend allows up to 4.6).

--- a/src/gallium/frontends/glx/xlib/glx_api.c
+++ b/src/gallium/frontends/glx/xlib/glx_api.c
@@ -2714,7 +2714,7 @@
         ((majorVersion == 1 && minorVersion > 5) ||
          (majorVersion == 2 && minorVersion > 1) ||
          (majorVersion == 3 && minorVersion > 3) ||
-         (majorVersion == 4 && minorVersion > 5) ||
+         (majorVersion == 4 && minorVersion > 6) ||
          majorVersion > 4))) {
       generate_error(dpy, BadMatch, 0, X_GLXCreateContextAttribsARB, True);
       return NULL;
